_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-21T13:44:57Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T16:53:53Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123674","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123674","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123674.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123674.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Follow up on @Calinou's PR here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100279 to update this PR to the latest version of Godot.\r\n- The improvement over the linked PR is checking whether the textures are actually used considering the current features that are enabled. On projects where StandardMaterial might have textures accidentally set but unused in the final shader, this can be a pretty big reduction in the total shader count.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis PR sadly introduces an increase in pipeline count in about roughly 8% in the projects I've tested so far. I'd like to see what performance benefits we can measure in scenarios that have high memory bandwidth saturation (mobile or triplanar projects) to justify this change.\r\n\r\nI know @Calinou had some scenarios in mind to measure, and one of the reasons I looked into it is because a project I'm profiling does have significant bottlenecks due to being memory bandwidth constrained, but the scenario is too dynamic to measure reliably at the moment.\r\n\r\nI haven't noticed any regressions in my testing, but it's important to give it a careful static review regardless as it can be quite tricky to have a project where all the features are used.\r\n\r\n- *Bugsquad edit: This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100279 by superseding it.*","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123674/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":3,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123674/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}